sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Admin
  participant API as Operations
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  A->>API: upload CSV
  API->>DB: tarefa PENDING + outbox
  API-->>A: 202 taskId
  API->>MQ: evento import.requested
  MQ-->>API: consumo/retry
  API->>DB: staging + relatório
  A->>API: confirmar publicação
  API->>DB: publicação atômica
